Common EducationOrganizationIndicator [2969]
    documentation "An indicator or metric of an Education Organization."
    descriptor IndicatorTitle [2970]
        documentation "The title of the indicator or metric."
        is part of identity
    shared string DesignatedBy [2971]
        documentation "The person, organization, or department that designated the program association."
        is optional
    shared string Indicator [2972]
        documentation "The value of the indicator or metric."
        is required
    shared string IndicatorName named IndicatorGroup [2973]
        documentation "The name for a group of indicators."
        is optional
    common Period [2974]
        documentation "The time period or as-of date for which the indicator."
        is required
